# DSH: skills are /skill:<name>; tool names are written bare, without backticks;
# no per-subagent model hint; plan-mode tools are snake_case.
AskUserQuestion	ask_user_question
`Agent`	`subagent`
\bBash\b	bash
`Read`	`read`
CLAUDE\.md	AGENTS.md
CLAUDE	AGENTS
multiSelect	multi_select
`ExitPlanMode`	`exit_plan_mode`
ExitPlanMode	exit_plan_mode
headless or scripted runs	non-interactive `dsh --profile headless` runs, no human to answer
headless / scripted	non-interactive `dsh --profile headless`, no human to answer
headless/scripted	non-interactive `dsh --profile headless`, no human to answer
无人值守 / 脚本化	非交互 `dsh --profile headless` 下，无人应答
无人值守/脚本化	非交互 `dsh --profile headless` 下，无人应答
